  "body": "Looking at [sticky activation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#sticky-activation) it seems to be calling [current high resolution time](https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-high-resolution-time) without a global (that is needed in order to know the time origin).\r\n\r\nIt'd be good to pass along the global. (`W` or `window`, if I'm reading the algorithms correctly)",
